<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>手机壳类目分析 · 导航页</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg1: #0c1018;
            --bg2: #111827;
            --panel: rgba(22, 29, 45, .72);
            --panel-h: #161d2d;
            --line: rgba(38, 49, 74, .9);
            --txt: #e6ebf5;
            --sub: #8c9ab2;
            --acc: #4f8cff;
            --acc2: #22c58b;
            --warn: #ffb020;
            --pink: #ff6b9d;
            --radius: 18px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0
        }

        html, body {
            min-height: 100%
        }

        body {
            background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 12% -8%, rgba(79, 140, 255, .18), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(900px 520px at 88% 8%, rgba(255, 107, 157, .14), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1000px 700px at 50% 115%, rgba(34, 197, 139, .14), transparent 60%),
            linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bg1), var(--bg2) 55%, var(--bg1));
            color: var(--txt);
            font-family: "WenQuanYi Micro Hei", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            padding: 0 20px 60px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* 星点背景 */
        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            background-image: radial-gradient(1px 1px at 12% 22%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .55), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 28% 62%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 44% 14%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .45), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 63% 74%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 78% 32%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 90% 84%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .45), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1px 1px at 8% 88%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .5), transparent 60%),
            radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 52% 46%, rgba(255, 255, 255, .35), transparent 60%);
            animation: tw 9s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes tw {
            from {
                opacity: .75
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1
            }
        }

        .wrap {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 1180px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* 顶部导航 */
        .topbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            padding: 22px 0 14px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 650;
            letter-spacing: .3px;
        }

        .logo .dot {
            width: 26px;
            height: 26px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            flex: none;
            background: conic-gradient(from 210deg, var(--acc), var(--acc2), var(--pink), var(--acc));
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79, 140, 255, .35);
        }

        .topnav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .topnav a {
            color: var(--sub);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            padding: 7px 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: .2s;
        }

        .topnav a:hover {
            color: #fff;
            border-color: var(--acc);
            background: rgba(79, 140, 255, .1);
        }

        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 52px;
        }

        .hero .kicker {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--sub);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 44px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -.5px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            background: linear-gradient(92deg, #fff 8%, #b9c6e0 55%, #8f9fc2 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        h1 em {
            font-style: normal;
            background: linear-gradient(92deg, var(--acc), var(--acc2));
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }

        .hero p {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 15.5px;
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 16px auto 0;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .hero p b {
            color: var(--txt);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* 卡片网格 */
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .card {
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 340px;
            padding: 30px 30px 26px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
            background: var(--panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform .28s cubic-bezier(.2, .7, .3, 1), border-color .28s, box-shadow .28s;
        }

        .card::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity .3s;
            background: radial-gradient(520px 220px at var(--mx, 50%) var(--my, 0%), rgba(79, 140, 255, .14), transparent 70%);
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);
            border-color: rgba(79, 140, 255, .55);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -22px rgba(0, 0, 0, .8), 0 0 0 1px rgba(79, 140, 255, .15);
        }

        .card:hover::after {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .card .ic {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .card.ind .ic {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(79, 140, 255, .22), rgba(79, 140, 255, .05));
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(79, 140, 255, .35);
        }

        .card.rev .ic {
            background: linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(255, 107, 157, .22), rgba(255, 107, 157, .05));
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 107, 157, .35);
        }

        .card h2 {
            font-size: 21px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .card .lead {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75;
            flex: 1;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .card .kpis {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin: 20px 0 18px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .card .mini {
            flex: 1 1 78px;
            min-width: 78px;
            background: rgba(11, 16, 32, .5);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 11px;
            padding: 9px 10px;
        }

        .card .mini .k {
            font-size: 10.5px;
            color: var(--sub);
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .card .mini .v {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .card .mini .v.s {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .card .foot {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            color: var(--sub);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            padding-top: 14px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .card .arr {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            color: var(--acc);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .card .arr svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            transition: transform .25s;
        }

        .card:hover .arr svg {
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }

        .card .path {
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 11.5px;
            color: #5f6d85;
        }

        .summary {
            margin-top: 46px;
            background: var(--panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 26px 30px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .summary h3 {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 9px;
        }

        .summary h3 i {
            width: 4px;
            height: 16px;
            background: linear-gradient(var(--acc), var(--acc2));
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .summary ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: grid;
            gap: 11px;
        }

        .summary li {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .summary li .n {
            flex: none;
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border-radius: 7px;
            background: rgba(79, 140, 255, .12);
            color: var(--acc);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
        }

        .summary li b {
            color: var(--txt);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        footer {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 12.5px;
            margin-top: 48px;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        footer b {
            color: #c3cee0;
        }

        .kbd {
            font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 11.5px;
            color: #5f6d85;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 1px 6px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }

            .topbar {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 14px;
            }

            .card {
                min-height: 0;
                padding: 26px 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

    <div class="topbar">
        <div class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>手机壳类目分析</div>
        <nav class="topnav">
            <a href="/industry">行业看板</a>
            <a href="/review">评论分析</a>
        </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="hero">
        <span class="kicker">Phone Case Category · Insight Deck</span>
        <h1>一份数据，<em>两个视角</em><br>看懂手机壳类目</h1>
        <p>从 <b>行业侧</b>看价格、品牌与供给节奏，从 <b>用户侧</b>看差评痛点与好评卖点。
            两份看板打通"市场在卖什么"与"用户到底在意什么"。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">

        <!-- 行业卡片 -->
        <a class="card ind" href="/industry">
            <div class="ic">📊</div>
            <h2>行业分析看板</h2>
            <p class="lead">覆盖 <b>171 款</b>样本、<b>63 个品牌</b>。从价格带分布、品牌集中度、上架时间三个维度刻画竞争格局与供给节奏。
            </p>
            <div class="kpis">
                <div class="mini">
                    <div class="k">样本商品</div>
                    <div class="v">171</div>
                </div>
                <div class="mini">
                    <div class="k">月销总量</div>
                    <div class="v s">191.8万</div>
                </div>
                <div class="mini">
                    <div class="k">TOP5 份额</div>
                    <div class="v">57.8%</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="foot">
                <span class="arr">进入看板 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"
                                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path
                        d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
            </div>
        </a>

        <!-- 评论卡片 -->
        <a class="card rev" href="/review">
            <div class="ic">💬</div>
            <h2>评论主题分析</h2>
            <p class="lead">按 <b>negative / motivation / positive</b> 三类主题聚合，共 <b>883 条</b>主题匹配。定位用户不满、购买动因与正向口碑。
            </p>
            <div class="kpis">
                <div class="mini">
                    <div class="k">负面匹配</div>
                    <div class="v">216</div>
                </div>
                <div class="mini">
                    <div class="k">最大痛点</div>
                    <div class="v s">耐用</div>
                </div>
                <div class="mini">
                    <div class="k">最大卖点</div>
                    <div class="v">耐久</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="foot">
                <span class="arr">进入看板 <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"
                                                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path
                        d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
            </div>
        </a>

    </div>

    <div class="summary">
        <h3><i></i>怎么用这两份看板</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><span class="n">1</span><span><b>定市场空间：</b>先看行业看板价格带分布，5–15 美元是供给最密集区间，≥40 美元与 20–25 美元存在客单价红利。</span>
            </li>
            <li><span class="n">2</span><span><b>定竞争格局：</b>TOP5 占 57.8% 销量、61.7% GMV，品牌集中度高，头部溢价能力强。</span>
            </li>
            <li><span class="n">3</span><span><b>找产品痛点：</b>评论看板中"做工与耐用性"占负面 26.29%，是最主要差评来源，对应正向卖点恰好也是"耐久性"。</span>
            </li>
            <li><span class="n">4</span><span><b>做差异化决策：</b>耐久可靠性是同时出现在最大痛点与最大卖点的变量，是最值得投入的产品差异化方向。</span>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</div>

<script>
    // 卡片光晕跟随鼠标
    document.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(function (c) {
        c.addEventListener('mousemove', function (e) {
            var r = c.getBoundingClientRect();
            c.style.setProperty('--mx', (e.clientX - r.left) + 'px');
            c.style.setProperty('--my', (e.clientY - r.top) + 'px');
        });
    });
</script>
</body>
</html>
